---
import { dunmorePlayed } from "../lib/first-run";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/");
---

<section class="ms not-content" id="start" aria-labelledby="ms-title">
  <p class="ms-eyebrow">Module 1 · Collection and coverage</p>
  <h2 id="ms-title">Start at step one: what did Kick actually collect?</h2>
  <p>You now know the seven steps a result should pass through, and the four ideas behind them. You do not yet know which steps Kick took.</p>
  <p><strong>Dunmore says 13. Your table says {dunmorePlayed}.</strong> Module 1 starts from Riley's prompt and follows what Kick's script actually did. Then it teaches you to compare what a collection should have gathered with what arrived.</p>
  <p class="ms-fine">About 55 minutes.</p>
  <a class="ms-go" href={`${base}modules/01-collection/`}>Start Module 1</a>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .ms { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto 3rem; padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 8px; color: #f4faf5; background: #0f4a33; line-height: 1.55; scroll-margin-top: 5rem; }
  .ms p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
  .ms h2 { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: #f4faf5; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4.2vw, 1.9rem); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .ms .ms-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.3rem; color: #f4c62f; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ms strong { color: #fff; }
  .ms .ms-fine { color: #c9ddd0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .ms-go { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 52px; margin-top: 0.4rem; padding: 0.7rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1.1rem; background: #f4c62f; color: #1b1a0c !important; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; }
  .ms-go:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f4c62f; outline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
